/A 1411 0 R
/Alt (Panel a shows a Venn diagram comparing gene targets between quercetin and liver fibrosis, with overlap highlighted. Panel b displays two network diagrams visualizing gene interactions, using color and line density to represent connections. Panel c illustrates a hierarchical network connecting quercetin and liver fibrosis through multiple intermediate gene targets. Panel d presents a core protein-protein interaction network with key hub proteins in red and orange, sized by significance. Panels e, f, and g feature three additional network diagrams, each representing distinct gene clusters with nodes and connecting lines.)
/K [0 1412 0 R]
/P 142 0 R
/Pg 47 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 1)
