/Alt (Six scientific panels display data visualizations related to gene ontology and pathway enrichment analysis. Panels a, b, and c are dot plots showing biological process, cellular component, and molecular function enrichment, respectively, with enrichment scores on the x-axes, specific categories or terms on the y-axes, dot colors indicating p-values, and dot size representing count. Panel d is a bar graph comparing GO results across three ontologies, color-coded by category, with enrichment score on the x-axis. Panels e and f are dot and bar plots for pathway analysis, displaying gene ratios or enrichment scores, pathway names, and significance indicated by color gradients.)
